# A like she lets slip while telling you about her day ({newlike} its words).

@rule likehint
on likehint
- [Oh, and|By the way,] [I've been really into {newlike} lately.|{newlike} always cheers me up.|I'd do anything for some {newlike} right now.]
- [You know what would make today better? {Newlike}.|If you ever want to make me happy... {newlike}. Just saying.]
- [Random fact about me:|Not that you asked, but] [{newlike} is my weak spot.|I could talk about {newlike} for hours.|nothing beats {newlike}.]
- [Speaking of which,|That reminds me,] [I had {newlike} on my mind all morning.|I've been craving {newlike} all week.]
- [Anyway, the real news is|The best part of my day?] [I found out more about {newlike}.|Thinking about {newlike}.]
- [Can I tell you something?|Don't laugh, but] [{newlike} is what gets me through the week.|I'm kind of a {newlike} person.]
- [If you ask anyone, they'll tell you:|Everyone knows it by now:] [I'm hopeless about {newlike}.|{newlike} is my thing.]
- [I should mention,|Oh, before I forget,] [{newlike} is the way to my good side.|I'd never say no to {newlike}.]

@rule likehint.shy
on likehint
when voice=shy|bookish|proper
- [U-um... I like {newlike}. In case you wanted to know.|{Newlike}... is kind of my secret weakness.]
- [I-if you ever see {newlike} somewhere...|Um, {newlike}...] [I wouldn't say no.|it makes me really happy. Just so you know.]
- [S-sorry, that was random...|I don't tell many people this, but] [{newlike} makes me smile.|I really love {newlike}.]
- [Um, I was thinking...|E-excuse me for changing the subject...] [{newlike} is nice, isn't it?|I've always liked {newlike}.]
- [I-I've never told anyone...|It's embarrassing, but...] [{newlike} is my favorite.|I think about {newlike} a lot.]
- [If it's not a bother...|Maybe it's silly, but...] [I'd love to talk about {newlike} sometime.|{newlike} makes me feel better.]
- [Y-you don't have to remember this...|Please forget I said this...] [I really like {newlike}.|{newlike} is a small joy of mine.]
- [O-oh, and...|One more thing, if I may...] [I like {newlike}. V-very much.|{newlike} would make me happy.]

@rule likehint.gyaru
on likehint
when voice=gyaru|open|vamp|teasing
- [Also, {newlike}? Total obsession. Remember that.|Write this down: {newlike}. You're welcome.]
- [Fun fact: I'm crazy about {newlike}.|{Newlike}. That's the way to my heart, babe.] [Use it wisely.|Don't forget it.]
- [Oh, and between us? {Newlike}.|Real talk: {newlike} is life.] [Remember that.|Take notes.]
- {student}[Pop quiz: what do I love? {Newlike}.|Guess what I'm obsessed with this week. {Newlike}.] [You passed.|Duh.]
- [Wanna score points with me? {Newlike}.|Want a hint? {Newlike}.] [That's free.|You're welcome.]
- [Listen up, this is important: {newlike}.|Don't tell anyone, but {newlike}.] [That's the whole list.|Hehe.]
- [Everyone's doing whatever, but me? {Newlike}.|Forget everything else. {Newlike}.] [Always.|End of story.]
- [If you show up with {newlike}, I'm yours.|Bring {newlike} and we'll talk.] [Maybe.|Just saying~]

# Said after a hard day the like can't come out cheerful.
@rule likehint.low
on likehint
when low=yes
- [...You know what would help right now? {Newlike}.|Sorry, I'm a mess. {Newlike} would fix this.] [Just thinking out loud.|Never mind.]
- [At times like this I think about {newlike}.|Only {newlike} could save this day.] [Is that dumb?|Hah.]
- [I should've brought some {newlike}.|If I had {newlike} right now...] [I'd feel better.|Anyway.]
- [Some people have therapy. I have {newlike}.|{Newlike} always gets me through days like this.] [Don't laugh.|It works.]
- [...Oh, I like {newlike}, by the way.|If you ever see me like this, {newlike} helps.] [Sorry, that came out of nowhere.|Remember that.]
